{"id": "Dd5Y1efox5_", "title": "Video by sabyasachiofficial", "description": "SABYASACHI BRIDAL COUTURE \nClothing, Jewellery, Accessories\nInspired by J.G. Ballard’s ‘The Garden of Time’\n\n“For 25 years we have designed heritage bridal ensembles for our South Asian customers worldwide. Seeing the surge of multicultural diaspora weddings, we bring a new inclusive language to Indian couture bridal that introduces the joys of our textiles, crafts and design to the world. For culture to be relevant, it must be dynamic.” \n \n \n@tarunvishwaofficial @paraffinfilms @miteshrajani @eugeniya.belousova @vaanirastogi @sehazksidhu @mishra_debojyoti @theleelapalacebengaluru\n#Sabyasachi #TheWorldOfSabyasachi #SabyasachiJewellery #SabyasachiAccessories #BridesOfSabyasachi", "channel": "sabyasachiofficial", "uploader_id": "1812374930", "uploader": "Sabyasachi", "timestamp": 1790739609, "like_count": 34655, "comment_count": 97, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1643362214129255a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 53.09, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fccj8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOC97VOX0Z7jg9qYdA8LVfkcSOn9-kbAXjutMKDqebHZylFoO0qnAghQxZgdDbJ4m4wRlNY71nYQAfbLdeuu-2oBgAZ_30NUBW3U6U.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=AdpJeohUGDIQxkryHzbzWc-YvnPqBPlOCKp1S2NaT4UPXTuWEf6noivEbyq-kNcOyH8&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fccj8-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=SCgiA4BQBmIQ7kNvwHDeveQ&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=rhDNhn2exqw3eGM-HV1M_A&_nc_ss=7b689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQOVr_XAfrGvbUCeeY0uqPTdbh1TflAPIXaIuEJOYPR34g&oe=6AD0D76C", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 53.09, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Ac